# Prometheus runs on each site's monitoring VM
- Monitoring (wil):
    # On this VPS, in Homepage's compose project; one Grafana for both sites
    - Grafana:
        icon: grafana.png
        description: Dashboards
        href: http://dashboard:3000
        siteMonitor: http://grafana:3000

    - Prometheus:
        icon: prometheus.png
        description: Metrics
        href: https://prometheus.wil.5am.cloud
        siteMonitor: http://10.2.20.30:9090
        widget:
          type: prometheus
          url: http://10.2.20.30:9090
          highlight:
            targets_down:
              numeric:
                - {level: good, when: eq, value: 0}
                - {level: warn, when: gt, value: 0}

    # On this VPS, in Homepage's compose project; the widget reads the
    # `default` status page
    - Uptime Kuma:
        icon: uptime-kuma.png
        description: Uptime checks
        href: http://dashboard:3001
        siteMonitor: http://uptime-kuma:3001
        widget:
          type: uptimekuma
          url: http://uptime-kuma:3001
          slug: default
          highlight:
            down:
              numeric:
                - {level: good, when: eq, value: 0}
                - {level: danger, when: gt, value: 0}

- Monitoring (ldn):
    - Prometheus:
        icon: prometheus.png
        description: Metrics
        href: https://prometheus.ldn.5am.cloud
        siteMonitor: http://10.3.20.30:9090
        widget:
          type: prometheus
          url: http://10.3.20.30:9090
          highlight:
            targets_down:
              numeric:
                - {level: good, when: eq, value: 0}
                - {level: warn, when: gt, value: 0}

# Same targets as prometheus_node_targets in site_<site>/infra_monitoring/prometheus.yml
- Node Exporters (wil):
{% for target, role in [('10.2.20.30:9100', 'Monitoring VM'), ('10.2.0.5:9100', 'Media VM'), ('10.2.20.53:9100', 'Networking VM'), ('10.2.20.45:9100', 'Web VM')] %}
    - {{ target.split(':')[0] }}:
        icon: prometheus.png
        description: {{ role }}
        siteMonitor: http://{{ target }}
        widget:
          type: prometheusmetric
          url: http://10.2.20.30:9090
          metrics:
            - label: CPU Usage
              query: 100 - (avg by (instance) (irate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode="idle", instance="{{ target }}"}[5m])) * 100)
              format:
                type: percent
{% endfor %}

- Node Exporters (ldn):
{% for target, role in [('10.3.20.30:9100', 'Monitoring VM'), ('10.3.20.53:9100', 'Networking VM'), ('10.3.20.70:9100', 'Web VM'), ('10.3.20.55:9100', 'Gaming VM')] %}
    - {{ target.split(':')[0] }}:
        icon: prometheus.png
        description: {{ role }}
        siteMonitor: http://{{ target }}
        widget:
          type: prometheusmetric
          url: http://10.3.20.30:9090
          metrics:
            - label: CPU Usage
              query: 100 - (avg by (instance) (irate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode="idle", instance="{{ target }}"}[5m])) * 100)
              format:
                type: percent
{% endfor %}
